<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Telebras still an ING buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Telebras still an ING buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- ING Barings said it was maintaining its buy rating on Brazilian state-owned telecommunications firm Telebras .</p>
<p>-- It said Telebras is still cheap as it is currently trading at less than $100 per ADR.</p>
<p>-- It said its 12-month price target remains at $130-$150. It said, using the midpoint of that range, the potential capital gain is 43.2 percent.</p>
<p>-- Telebras preferred was up 1.05 percent at 105.70 reais earlier on the Sao Paulo bourse.</p>
<p>((-- Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo Newsroom, 5511 2485412))</p>
